* 27-Mar-90	SHL		Added CLI before call to WaitAndSendMsg
* 23-Mar-90	SHL		Split off logon code to comlink_logon.src
*				Now checks for redeye in use before login
* 22-Mar-90	SHL		Removed PHA PHX and PLX PLA from timer IRQs
* 20-Mar-90	SHL		Variable length message support added
* 16-Mar-90	SHL		Revamped logon code
*				Packdown happens after login instead of during
* 9-Mar-90	SHL		Added new Redeye support
* 6-Mar-90	SHL		Removed RG code support
* 28-Feb-90	SHL		Made compatible with Handy 1.1 release
*				Removed lots of #IFDEF bracketed code
* 8-Sep-89	LEA		Added IFDEF NO_BRKS to change breaks to nops
* 7-Sep-89	James Donald	Version finished for Cal Games
*
